#
# Conformance case: profiles/goal-recursive-ancestor
# AC-1: recursive transitive backward goal — tabled resolution over a parentOf
# chain a→b→c→d returns all reachable ancestors (b, c, d), status ok.
#
# No forward rules in this case: the schema declares ex:Person as a logic:Kind
# for projection back-ends; the EDB facts live in input.nq.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/profiles/goal-recursive-ancestor/> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

# Schema: sort used by the projection back-ends.
ex:Person a logic:Kind .
